NOTES
  - The guide page "Limitations" says of RESTCONF: "There are no known limitations to the RESTCONF
    implementation." The findings above contradict it on this build.
  - `show log tail 6` is refused ("% Invalid input detected") where `show log tail 8/10/12` work; not graded.

VERDICT: FAIL -- RESTCONF on the x230v2 cannot add or delete VLANs (no VLAN-database model; a create is answered 204 but nothing is created on the device, a delete of a real VLAN is 403 access-denied), and PATCH of an interface's `enabled` leaf answers 204 but changes nothing; interface disable/enable does work by PUT on the `enabled` leaf (proven on both link ends)
